t thing — I was reading up on it the other day and lost track, can you find my thuvum files?\", \"Hmm, not a lot there. What about in my pictures, anything turn up?\", \"Okay, and what about Nyvoe? Same thing, I'm just curious what's in there.\"], [\"anything tuesday?\", \"and next friday?\", \"thuvum files?\", \"in pictures?\", \"what about Nyvoe?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0010\", \"v\": [[\"umm who do I... who do I still have to pay back?\", \"oh hang on, who's in thuvum gang with me?\", \"ok back to the money thing — just the ones over fifty dollars\", \"different thing, can you show me photos of Margarethe Sinclair?\", \"ooh stick it in the Best of 2025 album\"], [\"Could you tell me who I still need to pay back, please?\", \"Sorry, quick question before I forget — which people are in thuvum gang with me?\", \"Thank you. Going back to what I owe, could you show me only the ones over fifty dollars?\", \"On another note, would you mind showing me photos of Margarethe Sinclair?\", \"Lovely, could you please add that one to the Best of 2025 album?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0011\", \"v\": [[\"total spent last week?\", \"friend from yoga's contact\", \"their events?\", \"how many?\"], [\"how much did i spend last week in total\", \"whats the contact for my friend from yoga\", \"what events r they coming to\", \"how many is that\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0012\", \"v\": [[\"notes in Money notebook — how many?\", \"delete every allotments appointment\", \"undo that\"], [\"umm how many notes have I got in the Money notebook?\", \"ok can you get rid of, like, every allotments appointment I've got?\", \"oh no wait, I didn't mean that, can you bring them back?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0013\", \"v\": [[\"I'd like to get everything squared away before the month gets going, so with Vrovsais in thuvum gang, can we settle up?\", \"Also, I finally got round to that errand yesterday, so could you tick off the nyvoe steps task?\"], [\"umm can you... with Vrovsais in thuvum gang, can you settle up?\", 